Mention that context injection improves factual accuracy and reduces hallucinations in LLM outputs.
When first presented the problem, articulate the steps in the RAG pipeline and highlight potential edge cases.
Be prepared to discuss how you would handle scaling issues, such as maintaining prompt token limits and optimizing retrieval latency.
