Next, it loads a pre-trained SentenceTransformer model to compute the embedding from the input text.
The document is embedded into a vector which, together with its metadata, is upserted (inserted/updated) into the Pinecone index.
Finally, a query is embedded and used to perform a similarity search in the vector database to retrieve the most relevant documents.
